# Secrets for Supabase Edge Functions.
#
# There are none required. Routing uses OSRM, which needs no API key and no
# account, so the `directions` function runs unconfigured.
#
# Optional: point routing at your own OSRM instance instead of the public demo
# server, which is free but explicitly intended for light use with no
# availability guarantee.
#
#   npx supabase secrets set ROUTER_URL=https://osrm.example.com
#
# supabase/.env is gitignored; never put a real secret in this example.

# ROUTER_URL=https://router.project-osrm.org
